!
! This test calculates the CC energy with the X2C Hamiltonian
!
**DIRAC
.TITLE
Water molecule. X2C Hamiltonian. CC energies.
.WAVE F
**HAMILTONIAN
.X2C
**WAVE FUNCTIONS
.SCF
.RELCCSD
*SCF
.EVCCNV
1.0E-9
**MOLTRA
.ACTIVE
3..17
**RELCCSD
.PRINT
1
.TIMING
.GRADIENT
.INTERFACE
DIRAC
*CCFOPR
.CCSDG
*END OF
